{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫播出節目巡禮2027，介紹來年多個全新綜藝及劇集，綜藝方面，以《大丈夫步步為營》及《三生有幸去黐餐》最吸睛，前者由娛樂圈兩大「愛妻號」羅子溢及洪永城擔任主持，兩人「首度聯手背妻出走」，直闖甘南海拔4千米秘境，挑戰高原車宿、策馬馳騁及體驗</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T14:25:46.481699+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T14:01:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T14:17:20.090151+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T14:17:20.090151+00:00","content_hash":"fc9d0b7b1fe43449d81207ecc65664c8e5759c23df20bddc9fc43b7d3cc1fbb2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}